## 7. Custom Bean Validators (ConstraintValidator)

The only custom validator in the project is `PetAgeValidator` / `@PetAgeValidation`, and it is NOT referenced by the owner request DTO or the `Owner` entity — it applies to pet `birthDate` only. So no custom `ConstraintValidator` runs in the create-owner path. For completeness:

`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/validation/PetAgeValidator.java` and `.../PetAgeValidation.java:9` (`@Constraint(validatedBy = PetAgeValidator.class)`). Not in scope for owners.

